# Deploy int after changes

When the user asks for implementation or fixes, deploy to the shared int stage as soon as the work is done. Do not wait for them to ask.

Use the HomeHub int deploy flow only: `pnpm sso` if AWS sessions are expired, then `pnpm deploy:int`. Never run a bare `sst deploy --stage int`.

After a successful deploy, confirm `$APP_URL` still uses the custom domain (not a random CloudFront URL). Hard-refresh `/plan` when the change is on the floor-plan editor.
